{"product_id":"born-to-run-1","title":"Born to Run","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"220\"\u003eA story that gallops straight into your heart — “Born to Run” by Michael Morpurgo is a tender, thrilling tale of courage, companionship, and second chances, told through the eyes of a greyhound with the soul of a hero.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"562\"\u003eWhen a young boy rescues an abandoned puppy from the canal, he has no idea that this dog will run through many lives — as a racer, a companion, and a survivor. Morpurgo’s storytelling is full of warmth and empathy, weaving a journey that captures the unbreakable bond between humans and animals, the sting of loss, and the joy of freedom.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"757\"\u003eIt’s a book that makes you cheer, cry, and believe in kindness — all in one sitting. Perfect for animal lovers, young readers, and anyone who believes every creature deserves a second chance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"867\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eAuthor: Michael Morpurgo\u003cbr data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"786\"\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"806\"\u003ePages: 240\u003cbr data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"819\"\u003eISBN: 9780007262433\u003cbr data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"841\"\u003eDimensions: 12.9 x 19.8 cm\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45775151366297,"sku":"17RA-39780007262433","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/x450.jpg?v=1759938788","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/born-to-run-1","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}